# Souls of the Lost (*/*+1): "As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card or sacrifice a permanent. Fathomless descent -
# Souls of the Lost's power is equal to the number of permanent cards in your graveyard and its toughness is equal to that number
# plus 1." Bot1 casts it off a Black Lotus, discarding a Lightning Bolt: the Lotus (sacrificed for mana) is the only permanent card in
# the graveyard, the instant is not one (CR 110.4a), so the Souls is 1/2. With no permanent on the battlefield (the Lotus is gone)
# the additional cost can only be the discard, so no mode is asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Souls of the Lost
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Swamp x3
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Souls of the Lost.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Souls of the Lost.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Souls of the Lost.Toughness = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
